@startuml i3-telephony-sequence-service-head-call
' I3 H2 — ДДС → service head call with a status proposal and the trainee's confirmation
' (docs/hld/80-telephony.md §80.3.3, §80.4, §80.6; D23, D24; epics E6b + E6c).
'
' Scope: memo mode, dds_brigade_call = ON, browser endpoint, the trainee's own leg of service 101
' (responder TRAINEE). Each `append` is one row in session_events in the same Unit of Work as the
' state change (D5), published to Redis session:{id}:events after commit (omitted for brevity).
' The per-turn pipeline events (USER_SPEECH_*, ASR_*, DIALOGUE_INTERPRETED, CALLER_TTS_*) are
' appended under this call_id as today and are omitted below.

title ДДС → service head (101): call, status proposal, trainee confirmation

skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam ParticipantPadding 6
skinparam BoxPadding 8

actor "ДДС trainee\n(plays leg 101)" as T

box "backend (FastAPI)" #EFF5FF
  participant "API\napi/routers/dds.py" as API
  participant "Use cases\napplication/dds" as UC
  participant "Domain\ndds/call.py, dds/personas.py,\ndds/responders.py" as DOM
  participant "SimulationRunner\n+ stage automation" as RUN
end box

box "infrastructure" #F3FFF3
  database "PostgreSQL" as PG
  queue "Redis" as R
  participant "LiveKit room\ndds-{session}-{call_id}" as ROOM
end box

box "voice-agent" #FFF6EF
  participant "VoiceAgent\n_calls[(session_id, call_id)]" as AG
  participant "ResponderContextLoader\n(no WorldTruth, no CallerBelief)" as RCL
  participant "ResponderTemplates\n(or LLM paraphrase)" as TPL
end box

== 0. Under ON the trainee's own leg is heard, not applied ==

loop every tick
  RUN -> DOM : due_scripted_steps(leg, script, now)
  note right of RUN
    SCRIPTED legs: steps applied (E5b, unchanged).
    TRAINEE legs under ON: skipped — the steps stay
    in the script, to be voiced by the head.
  end note
end

== 1. Start the call (E6b) ==

T -> API : POST /api/v1/sessions/{id}/dds-calls\n{kind: SERVICE_HEAD, assignment_id}
API -> UC : StartDdsCall
UC -> DOM : guard_dds_call_allowed (ON, plays_leg, line free)\nresolve_persona(catalog entry code 101) → BRIGADE_101
UC -> PG : append **DDS_CALL_STARTED**\n{call_id, kind SERVICE_HEAD, direction OUTBOUND, assignment_id,\nservice_type, dialed "101", endpoint BROWSER, room, persona_id BRIGADE_101,\nselection_reason BROWSER_BUTTON}\n+ dds_calls row (DIALING)
UC -> DOM : ring [transport_ready] → RINGING
UC -> PG : dds_calls.state = RINGING
API --> T : 201 DdsCallView + voice token (room-scoped)
UC -> R : publish voice:join {session_id, room, call_id,\ncall_kind SERVICE_HEAD, assignment_id, persona_id, endpoint BROWSER}
R -> AG : voice:join
AG -> ROOM : join (self-minted token)
T -> ROOM : join (browser, token)

== 2. The head answers ==

AG -> RCL : load(session_id, assignment_id, now)
RCL -> PG : snapshot of the leg, leg status, previous DDS_CALL_* of the leg,\nscript via the responder_scripts probe (INV 3)
RCL --> AG : ResponderKnowledge {persona, snapshot_values,\nsteps_due, steps_pending_count, leg_status_now, call_history}
AG -> PG : append **DDS_CALL_ANSWERED** {call_id, answered_by AI}\n(after answer_after_ms)
AG -> ROOM : «Начальник караула, слушаю» (pre-synthesised line)

== 3. First call: the head asks, the trainee's statements are matched by code ==

T -> ROOM : «Пожар, улица Ленина, 5, пострадавших нет»
AG -> TPL : interpreter → operator_assertions
AG -> PG : append **DDS_CALL_ASSERTION** per stated fact\n{field_path address.street, value_ru, matches_snapshot true}

== 4. Later call: the head reports what is due (and only that) ==

T -> ROOM : «Вы уже доехали?»
AG -> TPL : (speech_act QUESTION, slot status, knowledge)
TPL --> AG : «Прибыли на место в 14:32, наряд 2415»
AG -> PG : append **DDS_CALL_STATUS_PROPOSED**\n{call_id, assignment_id, service_type, status ARRIVED,\norder_number "2415", script_after_ms, due_offset_ms, at_offset_ms}
AG -> ROOM : speak the line
note over AG, TPL
  A step not yet due is never spoken: «Пока в пути, доложу позже» (INV 2).
  The proposal changes no leg: the AI proposes, the trainee commits (INV 4).
  Several due steps ⇒ several proposals in script order (here the leg is
  already RESPONSE_STARTED); the trainee confirms them one step at a time.
end note

== 5. Hang up ==

T -> API : POST …/dds-calls/{call_id}/hang-up
API -> UC : EndDdsCall
UC -> PG : append **DDS_CALL_ENDED** {call_id, reason HANGUP, duration_ms}\n+ dds_calls row (ENDED)
UC -> R : publish voice:cancel:{session_id} {call_id, reason HANGUP}
R -> AG : leave the room

== 6. The trainee confirms the heard status (existing command, additive key) ==

T -> API : POST /api/v1/sessions/{id}/dds/legs/{assignment_id}/status\n{status ARRIVED, order_number "2415", proposed_by_call_id}
API -> UC : SetServiceStatus
UC -> DOM : proposed_by_call_id names a DDS_CALL_STATUS_PROPOSED of this leg\n(else 422 PROPOSAL_UNKNOWN);\nSERVICE_RESPONSE_TRANSITIONS one step at a time (409 INVALID_TRANSITION)
UC -> PG : append **DDS_SERVICE_STATUS_SET**\n{…, source TRAINEE, proposed_by_call_id}\n+ dds_service_status_history row
API --> T : 200 DdsLegView

@enduml
